{"id":"a56025295f88eafd","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-exponentials.md","title":"Definition — 预层指数的自然变换构造","display":"Definition — 预层指数的自然变换构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-exponentials","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-exponentials"],"display":"Definition — 预层指数的自然变换构造","source_ref":"I.6, pp.44–47; I, Exercise 8, p.63","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-exponentials"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-exponentials</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层指数的自然变换构造"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.6, pp.44–47; I, Exercise 8, p.63"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e213602dd9109075\" href=\"?note=e213602dd9109075\" title=\"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families\">14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为 Yoneda 函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nat}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Nat}(A,B)\\)</span> 为预层间自然变换集合；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(u):yD\\to yC\">\\(y(u):yD\\to yC\\)</span>。以下定义指数候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^P\">\\(Q^P\\)</span> 及求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}:Q^P\\times P\\to Q\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}:Q^P\\times P\\to Q\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Nat}\\)</span> 的带源靶自然变换集合使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e213602dd9109075\" href=\"?note=e213602dd9109075\" title=\"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families\">14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families</a> 的正式定义；函子的求值按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^P(C)=\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q),\\qquad Q^P(u)(\\theta)=\\theta\\circ(y(u)\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^P(C)=\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q),\\qquad Q^P(u)(\\theta)=\\theta\\circ(y(u)\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_C(\\theta,p)=\\theta_C(\\operatorname{id}_C,p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ev}_C(\\theta,p)=\\theta_C(\\operatorname{id}_C,p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该自然变换集合是小指标集合上函数集合乘积的子集，因此仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 集合。箭头赋值的恒等与复合律来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>。求值的自然性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 对源范畴箭头的自然性。它不是逐点函数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(C)^{P(C)}\">\\(Q(C)^{P(C)}\\)</span>；一个指数元素还必须对所有进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的箭头给出相容信息。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.6, pp.44–47; I, Exercise 8, p.63。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families","status":"resolved","id":"e213602dd9109075","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"93c6dd137bf8628e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families","status":"resolved","id":"e213602dd9109075","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Nat}$ 的带源靶自然变换集合使用 [[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]] 的正式定义；函子的求值按 [[14-df-category]] 解释。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Nat}$ 的带源靶自然变换集合使用 [[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]] 的正式定义；函子的求值按 [[14-df-category]] 解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nat}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"y(u):yD\\to yC","display":false},{"tex":"Q^P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}:Q^P\\times P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nat}","display":false},{"tex":"Q^P(C)=\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q),\\qquad Q^P(u)(\\theta)=\\theta\\circ(y(u)\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_C(\\theta,p)=\\theta_C(\\operatorname{id}_C,p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"Q(C)^{P(C)}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials|df-190 — 预层指数的自然变换构造]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials|df-190 — 预层指数的自然变换构造]]"},{"id":"fa971ebc9fa7af70","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,Q,R$ 为同一小范畴上的预层，指数和求值见 [[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]。$h:R\\times P\\to Q$、$k:R\\to Q^P$ 为自然变换；$u:D\\to C$，$r\\in R(C)$，$p\\in P(D)$。"},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e213602dd9109075","99b72d10a7d872f5","300365f146cacc8a","93c6dd137bf8628e","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}